<title>FINLAND: ILKKA JAN-APRIL PROFIT DROPS 34 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ILKKA JAN-APRIL PROFIT DROPS 34 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     7.7 vs 11.7</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   3.28 vs 5.92</p>
<p> Net sales					   73.5 vs 83.2</p>
<p> Operating profit				   7.5 vs 11.2</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	13.1 vs 17.0</p>
<p> Depreciation					 5.6 vs 5.9</p>
<p> Net financial items			 gain 0.2 vs 0.6 gain</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	  7.7 vs 11.7</p>
<p> Taxes						  2.7 vs 3.9</p>
<p> Net profit					   6.2 vs 9.1</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		75 vs 72</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish media group is Ilkka Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
